the raft, drowning...

94
00:07:39.125 --> 00:07:41.435
Fucking bitch knew it too.

95
00:07:41.594 --> 00:07:43.972
But she had a way about her.

96
00:07:44.764 --> 00:07:46.300
You know, it's like--

97
00:07:47.333 --> 00:07:49.745
It's like that she knew
what was good for you

98
00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:57.087
So did you do it?

99
00:08:03.082 --> 00:08:05.494
It was the best trip of my life.

100
00:08:08.287 --> 00:08:10.893
She was one of those girls,
you know?

101
00:08:11.791 --> 00:08:13.634
No matter what
you were going through

102
